================================================================================
FFmpeg (external binary, not bundled)
================================================================================

Component: ffmpeg (and ffprobe where applicable), invoked as an external
process for resampling (libsoxr) and mix export (WAV/FLAC/MP3).

Song Maker does not ship an ffmpeg binary in the Tauri installer bundle
(tauri.conf.json defines icons only; resolution is via PATH, winget-style
locations, or SONG_MAKER_FFMPEG). The user installs ffmpeg separately; the
README recommends builds such as Gyan.FFmpeg on Windows.

FFmpeg is licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License (LGPL) version
2.1 or later; some optional components and common full builds (including many
Gyan.dev Windows builds) are under GPL version 2 or later when GPL-enabled
parts are included. See https://ffmpeg.org/legal.html

Song Maker does not convey ffmpeg with the application; GPL source-offer
obligations for ffmpeg apply to whoever distributes a given ffmpeg build, not
to Song Maker solely for invoking a user-installed binary.

