================================================================================

Third-party crates are resolved via Cargo.lock. As of the license audit for
issue #173, `cargo license` in src-tauri reports:

  - MIT (majority of GUI/runtime crates)
  - Apache-2.0 OR MIT (majority of ecosystem crates, including Tauri)
  - MPL-2.0 (5 crates): cssparser, cssparser-macros, dtoa-short, option-ext,
    selectors
  - Apache-2.0 OR LGPL-2.1-or-later OR MIT (2 crates): r-efi
  - (Apache-2.0 OR MIT) AND Unicode-3.0 (1 crate): unicode-ident
  - Unicode-3.0 (ICU / normalization stack): icu_collections, icu_locale_core,
    icu_normalizer, icu_normalizer_data, icu_properties, icu_properties_data,
    icu_provider, litemap, potential_utf, tinystr, writeable, yoke, yoke-derive,
    zerofrom, zerofrom-derive, zerotrie, zerovec, zerovec-derive

